        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a side to fight for—Ants or Bees—and defend your colony against the other! Collect your insect army and use it to defend the hive in an awesome tower defense adventure, brought to life with hand-drawn visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With several interesting tower combinations and over 22 towers to choose from, enjoy endless gameplay in a unique hand-drawn art style with Hivefront TD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >22+ Powerful Ant and Bee Towers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with two strong upgrade paths where you can always see the upgrades you bought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Anywhere!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player offline works even when your WiFi doesn’t!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 Hand Drawn Maps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more planned to be added in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br>*********</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Super Ant Studio Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a team of two developers that, frankly, should be studying for finals, but we felt like making a game instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We really think that everyone who is willing to give our game a shot is CERTIFIED AWESOME. Feel free to drop in our Discord server and say hi, or recommend new content! You can also contact us via email if you want to reach out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hivefront TD contains in-game DLC that can be purchased with real money. Your purchases fund our development updates and new games. SERIOUSLY. Right now we are broke college students. Every vote of confidence you give us encourages us to keep going and make our game better than it ever has been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Super Ant Studio Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love hearing from our players, so please get in touch with us whether it be on Discord, Email, or on social media with any feedback—positive or negative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the hive is not going to defend itself… Put together your team of ants or bees and make sure nothing gets past!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a side to fight for—Ants or Bees—and defend your colony against the other! Collect your insect army and use it to defend the hive in an awesome tower defense adventure, brought to life with hand-drawn visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With several interesting tower combinations and over 22 towers to choose from, enjoy endless gameplay in a unique hand-drawn art style with Hivefront TD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >22+ Powerful Ant and Bee Towers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with two strong upgrade paths where you can always see the upgrades you bought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Anywhere!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player offline works even when your WiFi doesn’t!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 Hand Drawn Maps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more planned to be added in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br>*********</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Super Ant Studio Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a team of two developers that, frankly, should be studying for finals, but we felt like making a game instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We really think that everyone who is willing to give our game a shot is CERTIFIED AWESOME. Feel free to drop in our Discord server and say hi, or recommend new content! You can also contact us via email if you want to reach out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hivefront TD contains in-game DLC that can be purchased with real money. Your purchases fund our development updates and new games. SERIOUSLY. Right now we are broke college students. Every vote of confidence you give us encourages us to keep going and make our game better than it ever has been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Super Ant Studio Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love hearing from our players, so please get in touch with us whether it be on Discord, Email, or on social media with any feedback—positive or negative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the hive is not going to defend itself… Put together your team of ants or bees and make sure nothing gets past!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Collect your insect army and defend the hive as either Ants or Bees in this awesome tower defense adventure, brought to life with a hand-drawn art style!",
